  "verseCount": 13,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HEB 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muprista Mukuru weSungano Itsva",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shoko guru pane izvozvi zvatiri kutaura ndiro iri rokuti: Tino muprista mukuru akadai, akagara kurudyi rwechigaro chaIshe kudenga,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "uye anoshumira muimba tsvene, iyo tabhenakeri chaiyo yakamiswa naIshe, kwete nomunhu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muprista mukuru, mumwe nomumwe, akagadzwa kuti ape zvipo nezvibayiro kuna Mwari, naizvozvo zvakanga zvakafanira kuti uyu ave nechokubayirawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dai akanga ari panyika, angadai asina kuva muprista, nokuti vaprista vakanga varipo kare vaibayira zvipo sezvakarehwa nomurayiro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vaishumira panzvimbo tsvene inova mufananidzo nomumvuri wezviri kudenga. Nokuda kweizvi Mozisi akayambirwa paakanga ava kuvaka tabhenakeri: \"Uve nechokwadi kuti waita zvose maererano nomufananidzo wawakaratidzwa mugomo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ushumiri hwakapiwa Jesu hwakapfuura hwavo pakunaka sezvo ari murevereri wesungano inopfuura nokunaka pane sungano yakare, uye yakasimbiswa nezvipikirwa zviri nani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuti dai pakanga pasina chakaipa nesungano yokutanga pangadai pasina kuwanikwa mukana weimwe sungano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi Mwari akaona kukanganisa kwavanhu ava akati:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"Nguva inouya, ndizvo zvinotaura Ishe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "yandichaita sungano itsva",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "neimba yaIsraeri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "uye neimba yaJudha,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haichazovi sesungano",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "yandakaita namadzitateguru avo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "pandakavabata noruoko",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kuti ndivabudise kubva muIjipiti,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nokuti havana kuramba vakatendeka kusungano yangu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "neniwo ndakavasiya,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q4",
        "vid": "HEB 8:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ndizvo zvinotaura Ishe.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyi ndiyo sungano yandichaita neimba yaIsraeri,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "mushure menguva iyoyo, ndizvo zvinotaura Ishe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndichaisa mirayiro yangu mundangariro dzavo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "uye ndichainyora pamwoyo yavo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ndichava Mwari wavo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:10"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "uye vachava vanhu vangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakuna munhu achazodzidzisa muvakidzani wake,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kana munhu kudzidzisa hama yake, achiti, 'Ziva Ishe,'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "HEB 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "nokuti vose vachandiziva,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "kubva kumuduku kusvikira kumukuru pakati pavo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuti ndichavaregerera zvakaipa zvavo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "HEB 8:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "uye handizorangaririzve zvivi zvavo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nokuti akati sungano iyi \"itsva,\" ipapo akashayisa basa yokutanga; zvino chinhu chisisina basa uye chava chekare chichaparara nokukurumidza.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.8.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
